display_name = "Sim Arena: First Contact"
briefing = "Three of them hold the far blockhouse and they are not coming to you — two pumps that only matter up close, and a rifle that reaches the whole floor. Standing in the open anywhere down the centre lane is standing in front of that rifle. Three lanes run the length of the floor: low walls you can shoot over, tall ones you cannot see past at all. Work up one of them."
